WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.184
Today we will use evidence to discuss a performance. Our work connects with other

00:00:05.184 --> 00:00:05.896
Ghanaian communities.

00:00:06.700 --> 00:00:09.239
Watch or listen carefully without interrupting.

00:00:10.700 --> 00:00:13.985
Record one strength in timing, expression or teamwork.

00:00:14.867 --> 00:00:20.037
Suggest one useful change and say how to rehearse it. Compare your result with a

00:00:20.037 --> 00:00:21.416
second example from Ghana.
